{"id":"estupidez","lemma":"estupidez","pos":"noun","rank":2145,"glosses":["stupidity (the property of being stupid)","dumb thing","dumb thing that is said, nonsense, malarkey"],"ipa":"/estupiˈdeθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"estupideces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-estupidez.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién haría una estupidez así?","en":"Who would do such a stupid thing?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"like this"}]},{"text":"No puede haber dicho tal estupidez.","en":"He can't have said such a stupid thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609073","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"saying, expression"},{"g":"such"},null]},{"text":"Los niños hacen muchas estupideces.","en":"Children do a lot of stupid things.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"No hay cura para la estupidez.","en":"There's no cure for stupidity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590016","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"cure"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Os parece una estupidez?","en":"Does that sound stupid?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459983","words":[{"g":"you all","l":"vosotros"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}